      "Preposition                       6  \n",
      "Pronoun                           4  \n",
      "\n",
      "🎯 KEY COMPARISON:\n",
      "   Verb-starting titles: Avg 1.08 checkouts (61 titles)\n",
      "   Noun-starting titles: Avg 1.08 checkouts (299 titles)\n",
      "   ➜ Verb titles perform 0.5% BETTER ✓\n",
      "   Article-starting titles: Avg 1.09 checkouts (179 titles)\n",
